{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15076","headline":"秦镜 · 独孤绶","name":"秦镜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万古秦时镜，从来抱至精。\n依台月自吐，在匣水常清。\n烂烂金光发，澄澄物象生。\n云天皆洞鉴，表里尽虚明。\n但见人窥胆，全胜响应声。\n妍媸定可识，何处更逃情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤绶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15076.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15076","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}